@booking = http://localhost:7001
@booking2 = http://localhost:7011
@gateway = http://localhost:7002

### booking-service: Postgres and Redis
GET {{booking}}/health

### Second booking instance (pnpm start:booking:2)
GET {{booking2}}/health

### payment-gateway: Postgres only
GET {{gateway}}/health

### Switches (runtime knobs; a restart resets them)
GET {{booking}}/admin/switches

### Unknown switch: 400 UNKNOWN_SWITCH
PUT {{booking}}/admin/switches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "nope": 1 }

### Back to defaults
PUT {{booking}}/admin/switches/reset
